# Phase 2 Implementation Plan

## Goal Description
Enhance the PG CRM (Project RAM V1) suite with:
1. **Clean White / Light Professional UI Transformation**: Replace dark glassmorphic styling with a crisp, modern, high-contrast white UI design featuring solid cards, subtle borders, clean typography, and professional elevation shadows.
2. **Dashboard Room Drilldown**: Allow Owner/Admin to click any room card on the Dashboard to open an interactive side drawer/panel displaying room details, currently accommodated tenants, and their complete payment dues & history.
3. **Owner Cash Payment with OTP Verification**: Enforce that marking payments as Paid via Cash is restricted to the Owner and requires a secure 6-digit OTP sent to the Owner's registered email & phone number before completing the transaction.
4. **WhatsApp API Pathway & Comprehensive Walkthrough**: Implement a full backend WhatsApp service (supporting Meta WhatsApp Cloud API, Twilio, and webhook endpoints) along with UI configuration/test controls and a step-by-step integration walkthrough.

---

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> - **Owner Cash OTP Flow**: When recording cash payments, the backend generates an OTP and logs/dispatches it to the Owner's email & phone. The UI provides a 6-digit OTP confirmation modal with a live dev helper badge so you can test seamlessly.
> - **Theme Overhaul**: All glassmorphism blurs and dark neon aesthetics will be transitioned into a clean, modern white enterprise interface (similar to Linear / Stripe / Notion dashboard design).

